<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 310-6 INNINGS CLOSED V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 310-6 INNINGS CLOSED V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN, South Africa 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa scored 310 for six from their 50 overs in the seventh and final one-day match against Australia on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 310-6 innings closed (Lance Klusener 92, Hansie Cronje 69, Daryll Cullinan 57 not out) v Australia.</p>
